7d5e63df050624dad6fd527977b9b32c93adf42","event_uuid":"98b7889b-ef28-4012-b69f-3cfb5e1b8a58","position":{"commit_sha":"eee496a97ddbf53fdf61464a2623f4b0b5e3f1a6","position":"1792360376365114894-98b7889b-ef28-4012-b69f-3cfb5e1b8a58"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"49b33d723b4d61bf20fc042dd7338e6883221d76a3f2813fc8155222d476ab30","event_uuid":"1cc1e2b9-e80a-4ade-af6e-f6f3fff1a0d7","position":{"commit_sha":"d897e2eb79b399179a75c1dd375ad7c90fa0ab3f","position":"1793660376206481294-1cc1e2b9-e80a-4ade-af6e-f6f3fff1a0d7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"08a0402def72764b581677e06cf143babe8af235900c05209db0fdccb79e1359","event_uuid":"bd4c6ea2-ee37-4b30-9fa3-9dcc61a8cea4","position":{"commit_sha":"e1d72019f48c91726065dcdc2ef60dff68608d67","position":"1793662394515645406-bd4c6ea2-ee37-4b30-9fa3-9dcc61a8cea4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-308_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"a85e3cd3-9e61-4f25-9de4-cd740e853b4d","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Triage 2026-10-25 (bug sweep): not worked, no code changed. The failure is in a Copilot CLI session's MCP authentication on the operator's machine (/mcp auth rebar). Root-causing it and verifying a fresh session needs that client and the operator's token state, which this sweep does not have. Left open for the operator.","timestamp":1792946083255068001},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Copilot CLI MCP write check 2026-11-02: comment posted through the rebar MCP server from a non-interactive Copilot CLI session started in a clean environment.","timestamp":1793660376206481294},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Landed: Gerrit 3243 merged as 9233a47ac6a (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1); docs/mcp-client-setup.md recommends ~/.zshenv. Verified 2026-11-02 from a clean environment (env -i zsh -c): Copilot CLI 1.0.105 listed 62 rebar MCP tools, show_ticket returned this ticket, and comment_ticket posted the write-check comment above. Remaining gap (GUI-launched clients after reboot; launchd value only set by refresh-mcp-pats.sh) is an open operator decision.","timestamp":1793662878335674001}],"created_at":1789059856506540001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"98b7889b-ef28-4012-b69f-3cfb5e1b8a58","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"dff5-6fe2-646c-4a0e"},{"link_uuid":"bd4c6ea2-ee37-4b30-9fa3-9dcc61a8cea4","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"bd04-720e-1a4a-4873"},{"link_uuid":"0a506aad-660e-47c5-a9d6-8f60d8bb8740","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"3ce7-88c0-1a07-4361"}],"description":"Observed 2026-09-10 in a Copilot CLI session on the rebar checkout: the configured rebar MCP server is absent from the session's available tools; the client surfaces 'MCP server rebar requires authentication. Use /mcp auth rebar to connect.' The agent only discovers the degradation indirectly (missing tools) and falls back to the local rebar CLI carve-out for all tracker ops, which works but bypasses the MCP routing policy in AGENTS.md (certified ops signed under the box's trusted signing environment, async gate starters, de-dup protection) and makes every tracker op slower. Impact: tracker writes/gates from Copilot sessions are un-certified relative to the on-box MCP path; if opcert environment enforcement (verify.require_environment + verify.opcert_enforce_since) is ever flipped on per ADR 0104, these sessions' gate ops would stop being acceptable.\n\n## Root cause (reproduced 2026-11-02, Copilot CLI 1.0.105, non-interactive `copilot -p`)\n\nThe workspace `.mcp.json` sends `Authorization: Bearer ${MCP_CLIENT_PAT_CLI}`. Copilot CLI connects and calls rebar tools when that variable is set. When it is unset, Copilot sends an empty bearer, the server answers HTTP 401 with an OAuth `WWW-Authenticate` challenge, and Copilot reports \"Browser-based OAuth required\" / `/mcp auth rebar` (Copilot debug log, `rmcp::transport::worker` OAuthChallenge status_code 401). The variable reached only interactive zsh: `~/.zshrc` sources `~/.config/rebar/mcp-pats.env`, but zsh does not read `~/.zshrc` for non-interactive shells, and the launchd copy published by `~/bin/refresh-mcp-pats.sh` was empty (it does not survive the 2026-10-28 reboot). docs/mcp-client-setup.md recommended `~/.zshrc`.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Host (done 2026-11-02): `~/.zshenv` sources `~/.config/rebar/mcp-pats.env`; launchd values republished from that file.\n- Repo: docs/mcp-client-setup.md recommends `~/.zshenv` and names the 401 / `/mcp auth rebar` symptom of a non-interactive shell.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Root cause recorded on this ticket: empty bearer from non-interactive shells, reproduced with the variable unset (401 OAuth challenge) and set (tool call succeeds).\n- [x] A Copilot CLI session started from a clean environment (`env -i` zsh -c, no inherited variables) lists the rebar MCP tools and completes one `show_ticket` read and one `comment_ticket` write on this ticket through MCP.\n- [x] docs/mcp-client-setup.md recommends `~/.zshenv` for zsh and names the non-interactive-shell symptom; checked by `grep -n \"zshenv\" docs/mcp-client-setup.md` on origin/main after merge.\n- [x] The change merges through Gerrit at LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/mcp-client-setup.md","reason":"recommend ~/.zshenv so non-interactive shells send the PAT"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","3ce7-88c0-1a07-4361"],["relates_to","bd04-720e-1a4a-4873"],["relates_to","dff5-6fe2-646c-4a0e"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"c3f1efdb-7d62-41df-af98-ab5ff83d334f","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d353-b81c-ba3b-4cde","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Copilot CLI session cannot use configured rebar MCP server: connection requires authentication ('/mcp auth rebar') that a non-interactive agent session never completes, silently degrading to local-CLI fallback","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["98b7889b-ef28-4012-b69f-3cfb5e1b8a58","fde5a448-4ee5-44c3-b461-56049c84b69a","1cc1e2b9-e80a-4ade-af6e-f6f3fff1a0d7","c94555bd-f7d9-4e54-9ba5-6e8a0d07bb89","5b0098bb-25cd-420f-90dd-2b425c97d3c8","75179a66-e250-45a8-b1be-8b70675498f4","c3f1efdb-7d62-41df-af98-ab5ff83d334f","ea5cd2da-f6af-49af-a6d3-e83301fcf672","bd4c6ea2-ee37-4b30-9fa3-9dcc61a8cea4","07087c47-7056-4ee2-85b9-47fbf828eaa9","d651f856-7922-451e-a9eb-970635e9c631","0a506aad-660e-47c5-a9d6-8f60d8bb8740"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793663045701818002,"uuid":"6b68f840-cbc2-4ae2-99f0-74387c62b01e"}